WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.940
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.940
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:07.150
Watch out!

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:13.200
<i>Summoned by a messenger
supposedly sent by Antoinette,</i>

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.000
<i>Oscar was ambushed by a
group of mysterious men.</i>

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:19.810
Who are you?!

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.250
Is this a deliberate ambush on
Oscar François de Jarjayes?!

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:23.880
State your name!

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:25.840
No matter. Kill her!

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:43.480
Good, the girl came along!

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:45.690
Rosalie!

00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:47.500
Help me!

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:58.080
Are you all right, Rosalie?!

00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:05.120
Oscar!

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:06.880
Oscar!

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:16.070
Die!

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:22.560
Oscar!!

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:24.060
Damn!

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:25.270
Retreat!

00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:35.480
Oscar!

00:01:35.480 --> 00:01:36.700
Just as I thought! It's Oscar!

00:01:37.190 --> 00:01:39.410
Y-You're... Lord Fersen!

00:01:49.030 --> 00:01:50.270
Lady Oscar...

00:01:50.270 --> 00:01:51.130
Lady Oscar!

00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:56.590
Oscar...!

