00:03:36.950 --> 00:03:42.280
episode

00:03:36.950 --> 00:03:42.280
"Suddenly, Like Icarus"

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:54.460
How dare they do this to my Lady Oscar!

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:56.900
I'll kill them!

00:03:56.900 --> 00:03:59.700
No matter what anyone says, I'll kill them!

00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:08.810
The doctor said it's not a life-threatening injury.

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.280
All right, Grandma?

00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:11.400
Oh, shut up!

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:13.350
You good for nothing!

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:18.360
Instead of letting them get Lady Oscar, you should have
been a man and let them chop off an arm or two!

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:20.890
That's enough, Nanna.

00:04:20.890 --> 00:04:22.110
Leave and get some rest.

00:04:25.690 --> 00:04:28.360
First of all, this is all your fault, Master!

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:33.130
How many times did I tell you that I was
opposed to you raising her as a man?!

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:38.630
Yet... You did it anyway and
now look at what has happened...!

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:41.630
All right, all right.

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:44.590
I know, I know. I was mistaken.

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:48.680
Now, let's go to the kitchen and
pour you a drink to cheer you up.

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:52.920
The muscle in her right arm
is severed halfway through.

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:55.320
She's to be on complete bed
rest for the next two weeks,

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:57.100
or her arm will become useless.

00:04:57.460 --> 00:04:58.630
I understand.

00:04:58.630 --> 00:05:01.560
Well then, I'll have the medicine delivered later.

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:02.660
Thank you very much.

00:05:15.810 --> 00:05:16.560
<i>Oscar...</i>

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:19.340
Oscar.

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:31.060
Oscar!

00:05:32.730 --> 00:05:33.820
Fersen...!

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:36.350
It was you.

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:40.060
I could have sworn I saw your face...

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:41.470
Oscar!

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:43.630
Here, put this on.

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:47.980
It wasn't a dream, after all.

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:50.490
Fersen, you've returned?

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:53.830
Yeah, it's been 4 years since I last saw you.

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:56.450
Thank you, Fersen.

00:05:56.450 --> 00:05:58.090
Thank you for saving my life.

00:05:58.090 --> 00:05:59.690
There's no need to thank me.

00:05:59.690 --> 00:06:02.620
I was just on my way to visit you.

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:11.980
Y-You're...

00:06:13.130 --> 00:06:16.170
Yes, we've met before.

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:17.450
In Paris' Temple district.

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:19.170
In the Temple district...?

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:25.190
<i>Are you all right, Mademoiselle?!</i>

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:27.150
<i>Yes, I'm all right.</i>

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:29.110
Ah, that was you!

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:30.950
I see.

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:32.750
So you've met before.

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:35.080
This is Rosalie Lamorlière{Moliàre}.

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:39.830
Thank you so much for saving her.

00:06:40.430 --> 00:06:43.400
It's all because I couldn't defend myself...

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:45.090
Lady Oscar suffered these injuries...

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:47.470
Don't be so hard on yourself.

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:50.360
Her wound will heal completely,
as long as she rests.

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:53.270
Do you have an idea who the attacker was?

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:55.220
Yes, we know!

00:06:57.520 --> 00:06:58.880
There's no doubt!

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:00.600
The only person who would
plot such a heinous act is—

00:07:00.950 --> 00:07:01.810
Rosalie!

00:07:03.140 --> 00:07:04.360
But...

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:08.540
You mustn't make such careless accusations.

00:07:10.210 --> 00:07:13.250
We have an idea,
but unfortunately, we have no proof.

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:15.150
I'll let you know once we do.

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:17.090
I see.

00:07:17.090 --> 00:07:18.890
Well, I'll be leaving now.

00:07:18.890 --> 00:07:20.120
Take care.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:20.950
Fersen.

00:07:21.990 --> 00:07:25.800
Aren't you going to see Her Majesty...
Lady Antoinette?

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:29.230
I have to go to Troyes for 4 or 5
days on my father's errand.

00:07:29.230 --> 00:07:31.820
I plan to attend one of the balls once I get back.

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:35.810
Are things the same with Lady Antoinette?

00:07:36.170 --> 00:07:37.690
Yes, she hasn't changed.

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:42.190
But she has become even more beautiful.

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:45.980
<i>Her beauty is beyond compare.</i>

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:49.450
<i>It's as though she were a flower in full bloom.</i>

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:54.610
<i>She's full of dazzling brilliance and grace.</i>

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:58.930
<i>However, she's anything but happy.</i>

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:02.460
<i>Always unfulfilled and unrequited...</i>

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:05.860
<i>She deceives herself with fun and games.</i>

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:09.370
<i>That is, until yesterday.</i>

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:17.560
<i>How delighted Lady Antoinette will
be when she learns of your return.</i>

00:08:17.950 --> 00:08:18.880
<i>Fersen...</i>

00:08:19.980 --> 00:08:22.420
<i>The past 4 years haven't changed you at all.</i>

00:08:22.420 --> 00:08:25.390
<i>I can see that by looking into your eyes,
like the deep ocean.</i>

00:08:27.120 --> 00:08:30.520
<i>How delighted she will be...</i>

00:08:50.810 --> 00:08:52.980
Goodness, where are your manners?

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:55.350
I always tell you to behave more lady-like, don't I?

00:08:55.350 --> 00:08:55.900
Mother!

00:08:56.520 --> 00:08:58.590
The servants are all saying...

00:08:58.590 --> 00:09:01.890
...that Lady Oscar was attacked and
suffered a terrible wound last night!

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:05.350
So what if she did?

00:09:06.030 --> 00:09:08.290
You plotted it, didn't you, Mother?!

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:10.860
What nonsense is this all of the sudden?!

00:09:10.470 --> 00:09:12.100
No, it's not!

00:09:12.100 --> 00:09:16.030
Last night, I saw Uncle return with some strange
men and his clothes were stained with blood!

00:09:17.510 --> 00:09:20.200
I saw them from my window, Mother!

00:09:21.780 --> 00:09:23.880
Your uncle was in an accident.

00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:26.040
His horse went wild and fell into a ditch.

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:26.040
No...

00:09:27.010 --> 00:09:27.850
That's a lie!

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:29.510
You're lying, Mother!

00:09:29.780 --> 00:09:30.970
Shut your mouth, Charlotte!

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:32.920
Mother...

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:35.690
They say your mouth can lead you to trouble.

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:37.890
Don't speak of such nonsense ever again!

00:09:47.240 --> 00:09:49.600
Horrible... How horrible...

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:53.400
How could she do that to
my beloved Lady Oscar...?

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:07.450
Attacked?!

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:10.170
Was Oscar wounded?

00:10:10.730 --> 00:10:13.380
I hear her right shoulder was injured
and will take 2 weeks to heal.

00:10:13.690 --> 00:10:15.000
I see...

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.840
I must send someone to
pay her a visit right away.

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:19.330
Madame Noailles,

00:10:19.330 --> 00:10:21.200
please tell Count Mercy to visit at once,

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:26.240
and to take with him a duck, truffles,
foie gras and the finest chocolates.

00:10:26.240 --> 00:10:27.850
Certainly.

00:10:28.510 --> 00:10:32.150
I've heard a Swede happened
to pass by and save her?

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:33.250
Yes, that's right.

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:35.480
I believe his name was Count von Fersen.

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:44.200
What... did you just say?

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:47.190
Count Hans Axel von Fersen.

00:10:47.190 --> 00:10:49.670
I hear he's a friend of Lady Oscar.

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:50.900
Fersen...!

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:53.970
Fersen!

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:55.380
He came back!

00:11:04.610 --> 00:11:06.350
<i>I believed in you.</i>

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:08.550
<i>I truly believed in you.</i>

00:11:08.550 --> 00:11:09.570
<i>Fersen...</i>

00:11:10.150 --> 00:11:13.550
<i>I knew you would come back to France some day.</i>

00:11:20.060 --> 00:11:23.230
<i>The Queen reflected on their
encounter from 4 years ago,</i>

00:11:23.230 --> 00:11:25.390
<i>when she was 18 years old.</i>

00:11:26.530 --> 00:11:32.120
<i>It was a beautiful and momentary
stillness in the dizzying flow of time.</i>

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:38.410
<i>Overcoming several hundred days and nights,</i>

00:11:38.410 --> 00:11:42.850
<i>filled with roses, diamonds,
splendid melodies and merry laughter...</i>

00:11:43.820 --> 00:11:47.720
<i>Overcoming the great distance
and space between them...</i>

00:11:48.360 --> 00:11:52.910
<i>Now, at age 22, Queen Marie
Antoinette was trying her hardest,</i>

00:11:52.910 --> 00:11:56.420
<i>to bear the rapturous throbbing
that returned to her heart.</i>

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:05.930
<i>A week has passed.</i>

00:12:06.510 --> 00:12:12.750
<i>Not a single clue had been found,
regarding Oscar's attackers.</i>

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:13.820
It's Lady Oscar.

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:15.580
My, it's been a while, hasn't it?

00:12:15.980 --> 00:12:18.550
She looks dashing in that bandage, as well.

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:21.050
Those eyes...! Oh, I think I'm going to faint!

00:12:22.050 --> 00:12:23.620
Oh, Oscar!

00:12:23.620 --> 00:12:25.010
Has your wound healed already?

00:12:25.590 --> 00:12:26.920
I greatly appreciate your concern.

00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:29.970
As you can see, I should be able to return to duty.

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:33.770
Oh, Oscar... I was so worried about you.

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:36.070
To catch the culprits as soon as possible,

00:12:36.070 --> 00:12:38.000
they're searching for them as we speak.

00:12:39.870 --> 00:12:41.940
Your Majesty is overreacting.

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:43.990
The culprits may just be some thieves.

00:12:49.050 --> 00:12:50.790
<i>Why are you staring at me like that?</i>

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:53.830
<i>Do you... Do you have any proof that it was me?</i>

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:57.020
<i>You have nothing, don't you?</i>

00:12:57.020 --> 00:12:59.720
<i>Unless you have some kind of proof,
you can't say anything.</i>

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:04.130
Presenting Count Hans von Fersen!

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:18.360
Your Majesty, I am glad to see
you in such fine health.

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:24.220
I arrived from Sweden a week ago.

00:13:24.220 --> 00:13:26.320
The weather is warm in France.

00:13:27.190 --> 00:13:29.520
It's... good to see you.

00:13:39.270 --> 00:13:41.540
<i>I thought my heart was going to stop.</i>

00:13:41.540 --> 00:13:43.970
<i>My heart is still throbbing!</i>

00:13:43.970 --> 00:13:45.070
<i>Because...</i>

00:13:45.070 --> 00:13:49.910
<i>It's because he suddenly fluttered down
before me as though he were Icarus!</i>

00:13:51.210 --> 00:13:52.880
<i>This sweet surprise...</i>

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:54.150
<i>This excitement...</i>

00:13:54.150 --> 00:13:55.180
<i>What could it be?</i>

00:14:00.590 --> 00:14:01.360
Marriage?!

00:14:01.660 --> 00:14:02.450
Indeed.

00:14:03.120 --> 00:14:04.900
I've come to France this time,

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:07.320
on my father's wishes to find myself a wife.

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:09.900
Then, your trip to Troyes was...?

00:14:09.900 --> 00:14:14.290
Yeah, I went there to hear about
some English Lady named Rigell.

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:18.130
She's from a good family,
so I'm sure my father will approve.

00:14:21.510 --> 00:14:24.910
This Lady Rigell... Is she beautiful?

00:14:24.910 --> 00:14:25.980
So I hear.

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:27.010
What about her character?

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:28.180
Her hobbies?

00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:29.380
Her education?

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:31.800
I wouldn't know. I haven't met her yet.

00:14:32.790 --> 00:14:33.960
You're going to marry her...

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:35.770
...even though you don't love her, Fersen?!

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:42.500
Then, Oscar, as long as you love someone,

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:44.650
does that mean you can marry them?!

00:14:47.540 --> 00:14:48.800
Well?! Tell me, Oscar!

00:14:48.800 --> 00:14:51.140
As long as you love someone,
you can marry them?!

00:14:52.470 --> 00:14:54.700
I'm sorry, I forgot about your wound.

00:15:00.310 --> 00:15:03.380
I'm sorry. I wasn't myself...

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:04.750
It's all right.

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:33.570
My, so splendid! How truly splendid!

00:15:39.650 --> 00:15:40.860
Your Majesty,

00:15:40.860 --> 00:15:43.500
this is the formal dress uniform
of the Swedish Light Dragoons.

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:47.930
I once asked you to show
me this uniform and now,

00:15:47.930 --> 00:15:49.970
you've finally answered my request.

00:15:50.360 --> 00:15:50.930
Yes!

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:53.570
It really suits you well.

00:15:53.570 --> 00:15:58.110
But why aren't you visiting
me as often as you used to?

00:15:58.110 --> 00:16:01.890
I've been worried that you
were upset about something.

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:04.840
Your Majesty...

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:09.180
Forgive me for speaking of
such personal matters.

00:16:09.180 --> 00:16:12.080
Actually, I am in the process of finalizing
my marriage arrangements.

00:16:12.750 --> 00:16:13.530
Fersen!

00:16:16.760 --> 00:16:18.260
<i>Marriage?!</i>

00:16:18.260 --> 00:16:19.580
<i>Did he say marriage?!</i>

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:24.360
I... I see...

00:16:25.070 --> 00:16:28.090
Well then... congratulations...

00:16:30.370 --> 00:16:31.840
Your bride...

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:34.710
Your... bride...

00:16:34.710 --> 00:16:36.380
...m-must be...

00:16:36.380 --> 00:16:38.940
...a wonderful... wonder-

00:16:45.720 --> 00:16:47.130
<i>Fersen...</i>

00:16:47.130 --> 00:16:48.690
<i>Fersen is getting married!</i>

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:51.940
<i>Everyone marries when they come of age...</i>

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:53.280
<i>That's what happens!</i>

00:16:54.060 --> 00:16:57.930
<i>So why am I surprised? So why am I crying?</i>

00:16:57.930 --> 00:16:59.630
<i>I'm not crying...</i>

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:01.430
<i>Yes, it's my tears...</i>

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:04.570
<i>My tears are streaming down all on their own...</i>

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:15.910
Why did you tell Lady Antoinette?!

00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:19.020
Why did you tell her?!

00:17:19.020 --> 00:17:20.100
Why, Fersen?!

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:24.060
How could I tell her that I love her?

00:17:26.190 --> 00:17:29.520
How could I possibly say I've fallen
in love with Her Majesty?

00:17:31.470 --> 00:17:33.170
She's the Queen!

00:17:33.170 --> 00:17:35.800
The wife of the French King!

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:41.710
There must be something wrong with me
to have such illicit feelings towards her.

00:17:42.810 --> 00:17:44.140
That's why I told her...

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:46.200
I had to!

00:17:47.150 --> 00:17:50.080
So that I can pull my feelings
away from Lady Antoinette!

00:17:53.150 --> 00:17:53.880
Fersen...

00:18:04.230 --> 00:18:07.310
You'll attend the opera concert
tomorrow, won't you?

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:10.840
See you then.

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:26.810
<i>How could I possibly say I have fallen
in love with Her Majesty?</i>

00:18:27.890 --> 00:18:29.360
<i>How could I possibly say that?!</i>

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:31.560
<i>How could I possibly say that?!</i>

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:39.330
<i>If they were allowed to love one another,</i>

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:42.360
<i>what a wonderful couple they would make...</i>

00:18:45.010 --> 00:18:46.400
<i>But you...</i>

00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:48.310
<i>What about you, Oscar?!</i>

00:19:12.100 --> 00:19:14.370
No, I can't go into the Palace.

00:19:14.370 --> 00:19:15.600
Fersen...

00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:19.670
I came reluctantly, because it's
an opera hosted by the King, but...

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:21.050
I'm sorry.

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:21.900
Please go alone.

00:19:24.450 --> 00:19:25.970
Please understand, Oscar.

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:40.360
Your Majesty.

00:19:41.230 --> 00:19:45.030
Her Majesty has a headache,
so she will be arriving a little late.

00:19:45.030 --> 00:19:46.080
Ah, I see.

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:14.030
Your Majesty!

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:15.770
Fersen!

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:21.950
P-Please forgive my ill manners yesterday.

00:20:22.340 --> 00:20:26.410
I won't be able to see you often
after you marry, will I?

00:20:26.410 --> 00:20:29.310
Yes, my father is old now.

00:20:29.310 --> 00:20:32.370
He hopes to see me settle
down back at my country.

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:34.610
I see... I'm sure he does.

00:20:35.150 --> 00:20:38.340
I'll tell the Minister of State
to send gifts, congratulating you.

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:43.300
You are too gracious, Your Majesty.

00:20:43.620 --> 00:20:45.990
Well then, I wish you the best...

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:50.970
<i>Fersen, is this the end...?</i>

00:20:52.530 --> 00:20:54.030
<i>What woman...</i>

00:20:54.030 --> 00:20:59.630
<i>...will you be embracing with your
broad chest and strong arms?</i>

00:21:00.170 --> 00:21:01.310
<i>No!</i>

00:21:01.310 --> 00:21:02.840
<i>I can't bear it!</i>

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:04.240
<i>No, no!</i>

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:07.280
<i>I can't bear the thought of you
marrying another woman,</i>

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:09.240
<i>the thought of another woman as your wife!</i>

00:21:15.190 --> 00:21:15.670
Here.

00:21:22.230 --> 00:21:23.220
Fersen...

00:21:24.670 --> 00:21:26.050
My Fersen...!

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:27.130
Fersen!

00:21:41.050 --> 00:21:44.690
<i>Since that night at the masquerade ball 4 years ago,</i>

00:21:44.690 --> 00:21:48.710
<i>their souls have secretly called
and yearned for each other.</i>

00:21:49.690 --> 00:21:53.370
<i>Their hearts were trembling like
the silver strings of a harp,</i>

00:21:54.960 --> 00:22:00.460
<i>all while anticipating that this moment,
destined by God, would eventually come.</i>

00:22:03.640 --> 00:22:04.860
Your Majesty...

00:22:04.860 --> 00:22:08.270
Please forget for now...
That I'm the Queen...

00:22:09.570 --> 00:22:11.710
Fersen, I love you!

