she was forced to face a new kind of agony.</i>

00:23:54.660 --> 00:24:00.100
<i>''We may be connected by blood, but that alone
doesn't harbor love,'' says Rosalie, resolutely.</i>

00:24:00.730 --> 00:24:04.370
<i>Meanwhile, her younger sister, Charlotte,
who is unaware that Rosalie is her older sister,</i>

00:24:04.370 --> 00:24:06.740
